  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Takes an RT-qPCR gene-expression experiment from plan to paper: a step schedule, NanoDrop quality checks and cDNA pipetting volumes, qPCR plate maps, Ct import and QC, reference-gene-normalised fold change, a recommended statistical test, publication figures, and draft Methods/Results text. All of it is kept in a downloadable .xlsx experiment file. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
